# E027 · Being Right About What You Meant

[Essay catalogue](../README.md) · [Original manuscript](original.md)

## How this essay was made

Part of the judge-guided series: a fresh author received criticism through two separate named-judge profiles, then revised. Eight essays were ultimately completed from the twenty initially planned. The profiles were experimental imitations, with no established fidelity to the real judges.

Campaign: `judges20-20260912` · Lineage: `essay-55`. The midterm ID is a blinded corpus label, not a rank.

Recorded model observations: `gpt-6-astra`, `gpt-6-astra / ultra`. These identify recorded configurations, not independent backend attestation.

